minhash-dedup

This project began with MinHash and supporting code extracted from DataTrove
(https://github.com/huggingface/datatrove), developed by Hugging Face and its
contributors under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The MinHash implementation has been modified for complete duplicate buckets,
cross-band pruning, weighted representative selection, covering and puncture
bounds, and document-ID-aligned signature diagnostics. Project modifications
also include dedicated stage scripts and a consolidated MinHash-only support
layer. Retained and adapted DataTrove code remains covered by Apache-2.0.

The hash helpers retain the hash definitions used by the extracted code, which
references https://github.com/ekzhu/datasketch/blob/master/datasketch/hashfunc.py.

This notice records provenance; renaming or restructuring modules does not
assert that retained or adapted code was independently originated.
